WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.013
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online TOEIC preparation.

2
00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:08.839
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.139 --> 00:00:16.331
Unit one: TOEIC Overview and Scores. Today you will understand the TOEIC Listening and Reading test and how scores work.

4
00:00:16.631 --> 00:00:19.237
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.340
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:24.183 --> 00:00:25.080
Listening.

7
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:28.524
Listening means the first section, with audio.

8
00:00:29.117 --> 00:00:31.209
Listening has 100 questions.

9
00:00:31.817 --> 00:00:34.167
Your turn. Say: Listening.

10
00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:37.895
Listening.

11
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:39.396
Reading.

12
00:00:40.383 --> 00:00:42.998
Reading means the second section, with texts.

13
00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:45.931
Reading has 100 questions.

14
00:00:46.517 --> 00:00:48.844
Your turn. Say: Reading.

15
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:52.631
Reading.

16
00:00:53.383 --> 00:00:54.210
Score.

17
00:00:55.217 --> 00:00:57.727
Score means the number that shows your result.

18
00:00:58.317 --> 00:01:00.409
My score is 750.

19
00:01:01.017 --> 00:01:03.448
Your turn. Say: Score.

20
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.150
Score.

21
00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:09.104
Workplace.

22
00:01:10.117 --> 00:01:12.639
Workplace means the place where people work.

23
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.215
The test uses workplace English.

24
00:01:15.817 --> 00:01:18.515
Your turn. Say: Workplace.

25
00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.588
Workplace.

26
00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.061
Part.

27
00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.177
Part means one section inside a paper.

28
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:29.458
Part 1 is photographs.

29
00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:32.273
Your turn. Say: Part.

30
00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:35.867
Part.

31
00:01:36.617 --> 00:01:37.745
Answer sheet.

32
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.574
Answer sheet means the paper where you mark answers.

33
00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:43.637
Mark the answer sheet.

34
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.960
Your turn. Say: Answer sheet.

35
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:50.882
Answer sheet.

36
00:01:51.617 --> 00:01:52.641
Certificate.

37
00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:56.857
Certificate means an official paper showing your score.

38
00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.659
The company asks for a certificate.

39
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.879
Your turn. Say: Certificate.

40
00:02:05.733 --> 00:02:06.897
Certificate.

41
00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.581
Section.

42
00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:12.036
Section means one main part of the test.

43
00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.255
Each section is timed.

44
00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:17.259
Your turn. Say: Section.

45
00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:20.985
Section.

46
00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.776
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:26.617 --> 00:02:28.581
Visal, what does TOEIC measure?

48
00:02:29.683 --> 00:02:41.101
TOEIC Listening and Reading measures English for the workplace and daily life. It has two sections, Listening and Reading, with one hundred questions each.

49
00:02:42.217 --> 00:02:44.297
How long is it and how is it scored?

50
00:02:45.383 --> 00:03:02.595
The test takes about two hours: forty-five minutes for Listening and seventy-five for Reading. Each section scores from 5 to 495, and the total score ranges from 10 to 990.

51
00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.242
What are the seven parts?

52
00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:21.785
Listening has Parts 1 to 4: photographs, question-response, conversations and talks. Reading has Parts 5 to 7: incomplete sentences, text completion and reading passages.

53
00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:24.468
Part three: grammar.

54
00:03:25.317 --> 00:03:29.023
Grammar focus: Strategy: know the seven parts.

55
00:03:29.323 --> 00:03:30.510
Look at the pattern.

56
00:03:31.217 --> 00:03:34.911
Listening has four parts and 100 questions.

57
00:03:35.817 --> 00:03:38.908
The total score ranges from 10 to 990.

58
00:03:39.867 --> 00:03:47.244
Learn the seven parts and their timing. Practise Listening and Reading equally because each section carries the same weight in the total score.

59
00:03:47.983 --> 00:03:51.727
Be careful! Don't say: I practise only Listening.

60
00:03:53.667 --> 00:03:56.003
Say: I practise Listening and Reading.

61
00:03:56.303 --> 00:03:57.815
Both sections count.

62
00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:01.403
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

63
00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.480
Setting a Target.

64
00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.557
Nary wants a job at an international hotel.

65
00:04:07.567 --> 00:04:10.867
The hotel asks for a TOEIC score of 700.

66
00:04:11.867 --> 00:04:14.400
She learns that the test has seven parts.

67
00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:20.232
She checks the timing: 45 minutes for Listening and 75 for Reading.

68
00:04:21.233 --> 00:04:23.198
She makes a plan for each part.

69
00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:28.302
Part five: quiz. Five questions. Are you ready?

70
00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:31.266
How many questions are in the test?

71
00:04:31.566 --> 00:04:35.823
A, 50. B, 200. C, 100.

72
00:04:39.367 --> 00:04:41.239
The answer is B: 200.

73
00:04:42.383 --> 00:04:44.186
Which part has photographs?

74
00:04:44.486 --> 00:04:48.476
A, Part 5. B, Part 7. C, Part 1.

75
00:04:52.033 --> 00:04:54.195
The answer is C: Part 1.

76
00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.524
The maximum total score is blank.

77
00:04:57.824 --> 00:05:03.126
A, 990. B, 495. C, 100.

78
00:05:06.667 --> 00:05:09.142
The answer is A: 990.

79
00:05:10.283 --> 00:05:11.610
How long is Reading?

80
00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:17.095
A, 10 minutes. B, 75 minutes. C, 45 minutes.

81
00:05:20.633 --> 00:05:23.480
The answer is B: 75 minutes.

82
00:05:24.617 --> 00:05:26.210
Why does Nary take TOEIC?

83
00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:31.011
A, for a game. B, for a trip only. C, for a hotel job.

84
00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:37.216
The answer is C: for a hotel job.

85
00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.935
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

86
00:05:42.783 --> 00:05:45.131
What TOEIC score do you want, and why?

87
00:05:53.917 --> 00:05:55.359
Now listen to Visal.

88
00:05:55.659 --> 00:06:10.342
I want a score of 700 because I would like to work for an international company. First I will learn the seven parts of the test. Then I will practise each part weekly with timed exercises.

89
00:06:10.642 --> 00:06:12.444
Excellent answer, Visal!

90
00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:18.533
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and strategy: know the seven parts.

91
00:06:18.833 --> 00:06:23.250
Today's value is ambition. Dream big and work hard for your future.

92
00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.063
See you in Unit two. Goodbye!

93
00:06:26.363 --> 00:06:28.934
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

